              <div class="project-context">Rust mathematics and graphics workspace</div>
              <p class="project-impact">Dense and sparse matrices, numerical methods and 3D transforms, with a wgpu renderer for native and web targets. An exploratory codebase connecting my graphics and systems work.</p>
              <div class="project-tags"><span class="project-tag project-tag--domain">Graphics / 3D</span><span class="project-tag">Rust</span><span class="project-tag">wgpu</span><span class="project-tag">Linear algebra</span></div>
              <a class="project-story-link" href="blog/posts/dimension-rust-math-rendering/">Read the Dimension article</a>
