              <p class="project-impact">Vue applets and a Rust/Rocket backend for arranging embedded services, saving layouts and controlling Docker containers. An older project with its original screenshots and demo.</p>
              <div class="project-tags"><span class="project-tag project-tag--domain">Platform &amp; DevOps</span><span class="project-tag project-tag--domain">Application</span><span class="project-tag">Rust</span><span class="project-tag">Vue</span><span class="project-tag">Docker</span></div>
              <a class="project-story-link" href="blog/posts/dashercontrol-homelab-workspaces/">Read the DasherControl article</a>
            </li>
            <li class="project-card">
              <div class="project-title"><a href="blog/posts/reverse-proxy-infrastructure/">reverse_proxy</a></div>
              <div class="project-context">Reverse-proxy infrastructure: Caddy, Terraform and Ansible</div>
              <p class="project-impact">VPS and Cloudflare DNS provisioning, Ansible role-based configuration, and deployment diagnostics. The source remains private; the article describes a simplified architecture.</p>
