              <div class="project-context">Linux homelab: media library in Docker Compose</div>
              <div class="project-impact">A <code>docker compose up -d</code> stack for standing up a media library on a Linux homelab, with downloads, *Arr automation, Plex or Jellyfin, remote access, and monitoring. The companion bash scripts help bootstrap a fresh host one service at a time before moving to the full compose setup.</div>
