                <div class="project-card-copy">
                  <div class="project-impact">Forked and now maintain an open-source integration from <a href="https://github.com/neilzilla/hass-renpho" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">neilzilla/hass-renpho</a> that brings Renpho weight, BMI, body fat, girth measurements, and goals into Home Assistant. I reworked the API client, the config flow, optional proxy support, and the related documentation.</div>
