    <p class="aeo-about-intro aeo-lead aeo-agent-only">Software engineer in Montreal working on platform engineering and interactive graphics. Delivery spans TypeScript, .NET, Java/Kotlin, Python, and Docker/Kubernetes, with master&#x27;s research in C++/OpenGL and Blender (real-time surface wear, friction, and textures).</p>
